 "$comment": "Kit icon ids (examples/mini-apps/_kit/icons.svg, an own line set) mapped to the SF Symbol, Material Symbols and Lucide names with the same meaning. The names help translate a design that cites those libraries; their artwork is not shipped (Apple and Google licences). Unicode emoji are never UI icons (anti-slop.md).",
 "grid": 24,
 "stroke": 1.8,
 "checked": "2026-11-26",
 "open_libraries": {
  "$comment": "When an icon is missing from the kit, take it from ONE open SVG library per app, never emoji, never SF Symbols artwork (Apple licence). Lucide first: the same 24 px line grid as the kit. Every kit id has its Lucide name below (checked against lucide-static 1.79.0 on 2026-11-24).",
